I'm sorry to say but Freenode banned the bridge account and banned several
accounts of IRC users.

No Lojban channels are bridged to or from Freenode. If you prefer IRC
please use irc.libera.chat as the new server address. I can see many
Lojbanists already migrated there.

Channel names are the same there: #lojban, #ckule, #jbosnu, ##jboselbau

All the ways of connecting are here:
https://mw.lojban.org/papri/Lojban_Live_Chat

